=== The Categorical 't Hooft Expansion (Davide Gaiotto)

QFT vs Math

RCFT, TQFT, Perturvative QFT, parts of twisted SQFT:math rigorous

twisted SQFT:categorical mirro symm, BFN, quantizaiton of twisted SUGRA and string/M-theory,.efc

Goal:invite a formalization of (Twisted) Holography

holography in an nutshell

Holography: family $"QFT"_N$ at large $N$ <--> quantum gravity $h tilde 1/N$

too schematic: $lim_(N->infinity) N^dots log Z_N (M_d,g)_"cl" (partial M_(d+1)=M_d,g_partial^(d+1) tilde g)

$

Better:turn on general couplings <-> bdy val of other fields

Even better: formal defom dg-sp of QFTN preserving large N lmit & formal sp of sol of dual eq of motion

$U(N)$ gauge theories with matrix-valued fields

#conj()[
  always holographic dual to "string theories"
]

't Hooft expansion in perturbation theory fixes $planck N$


Note:this happens in perturbative QFT, mathematically sensible

two paths to string theory:$U(N)$ gauge theory ('t Hooft expを通じて) or 2d worldsheet dg-TFT (genux expを通じて)で、closed string theoryへ行ける

$U(N)$ gauge theory ('t Hooft exp) -> 2d worldsheet dg-TFの道を作り、可換図式にしたい

formal deform of $U(N)$ gauge thy = qu master eq of closed string thy

2d worldsheet ->formal deform of 2d worldsheet=classical master eq of closed string theory

qu master eq -> classical master eq はclassical lmitを通じて

formal deform of $U(N)$ gauge thy+fundamental modificationより、qu master eq of "Open" + closed string thyとでき、

formal def of 2d worldsheet with with 1d bdyより、同じくopenが加わり、また、元の2d worldsheetとcobordism hypothesisで繋がる

limitはopen-closed classical lmit をとる

