On cpx alg surf $X$, alg fol is defined by class of mero vec field on $X$

The dichotomy:str stab vs bifurcation

${(X_lambda,cal(F)_lambda)}_(lambda in Lambda)$:fam of alg fol

$lambda_0$ is said to str stab if E:#list(indent: 2em)[
  nbd $cal(V)$. of $lambda_0$
][
