  Blow-up limit: Suppose that we have sol to Ricci flow which becomes sing at time $T<infinity$. sequence $t_j -> T$ s.t. $(p_j,t_j)$ goes to infinity.  zoom and dilate flow by large factor  to make curv equal to 1. bacckhistory extend and take limit as $j->infinity$, we obtain ancient sol
