  beta_(mu,2) (x,r)=inf_L (1./r^n integral_(y in B(x,r) ) (("dist"(y,L))/r)^2 d mu(y)) ^(1/2)


$

$E$ is unif $n$-rctifi if it is $n$-Ahlfors regular
